        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Whitework sampler illustrating progression from pulled work through cutwork including various forms of reticella, bottom 2 bands with free-form needlelace with Adam and Eve at bottom. Mermaid with mirror(?) fourth band from bottom.\n\nStitches: pulled work including double hem; cut work including buttonhole and buttonhole filling."@en ;
